            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Killer Queen Black</strong> is an intense team-based action strategy game where coordination, speed, and split-second decisions decide every match. Two teams face off in chaotic arcade arenas, each led by a powerful Queen and supported by Workers who can shift between gathering, riding the snail, or transforming into warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match offers multiple paths to victory. Fill your hive with berries for an economic win, ride the snail across the map for an objective win, or eliminate the enemy Queen three times for a military win. The result is a game where roles constantly shift, strategies collide, and no two matches play out the same way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to understand but difficult to master, Killer Queen Black rewards communication, adaptation, and teamwork. Whether you are leading from the front as the Queen, quietly pushing the snail, or making a clutch berry run under pressure, every player has a role that can turn the tide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 4v4 team battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three distinct victory conditions: Economic, Snail, and Military</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Queen or as versatile Workers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform Workers into powerful Warriors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-inspired action with deep strategic teamplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple maps with unique layouts and tactical opportunities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer and local play support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, highly competitive, and endlessly replayable</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663670/extras/d01b96c966a501c2aa831f2e2935e7cd.avif?t=1784665579\" width=100 height=112 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663670/extras/3c166489f81648f1c1e76374a478b84c.avif?t=1784665579\" width=200 height=147 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663670/extras/d407a277c7414b6064fef1669fcdd342.avif?t=1784665579\" width=130 height=135 /></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Killer Queen Black</strong> is an intense team-based action strategy game where coordination, speed, and split-second decisions decide every match. Two teams face off in chaotic arcade arenas, each led by a powerful Queen and supported by Workers who can shift between gathering, riding the snail, or transforming into warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match offers multiple paths to victory. Fill your hive with berries for an economic win, ride the snail across the map for an objective win, or eliminate the enemy Queen three times for a military win. The result is a game where roles constantly shift, strategies collide, and no two matches play out the same way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to understand but difficult to master, Killer Queen Black rewards communication, adaptation, and teamwork. Whether you are leading from the front as the Queen, quietly pushing the snail, or making a clutch berry run under pressure, every player has a role that can turn the tide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 4v4 team battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three distinct victory conditions: Economic, Snail, and Military</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Queen or as versatile Workers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform Workers into powerful Warriors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-inspired action with deep strategic teamplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple maps with unique layouts and tactical opportunities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer and local play support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, highly competitive, and endlessly replayable</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663670/extras/d01b96c966a501c2aa831f2e2935e7cd.avif?t=1784665579\" width=100 height=112 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663670/extras/3c166489f81648f1c1e76374a478b84c.avif?t=1784665579\" width=200 height=147 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663670/extras/d407a277c7414b6064fef1669fcdd342.avif?t=1784665579\" width=130 height=135 /></span></p>",
            "short_description": "Killer Queen Black is a fast-paced, team-based action strategy game where two teams battle for victory in a frantic arcade arena. Coordinate with your queen and workers to outmaneuver the enemy, riding snails, collecting berries, and fighting for military dominance across multiple win conditions.",
